<title>USA: HEARx expands Foundation Health pact.</title>
<headline>HEARx expands Foundation Health pact.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>HEARx Ltd said Tuesday it had expanded its contract with Foundation Health Systems Inc in a move that will generate about $750,000 in additional annual revenues for HEARx.</p>
<p>The contract concerns HEARx operations in Florida.</p>
</text>
